  _headline: "\xC1rea abandonada volta a receber gente"
  _headlineEn: Abandoned area welcomes people again
  _body: "Recuperar o degradado devolve o espa\xE7o aos moradores. A obra \xE9 cara,
    e a faixa da inaugura\xE7\xE3o j\xE1 foi encomendada."
  _bodyEn: Restoring rundown spaces gives them back to residents. The work is costly,
    and the opening banner is already on order.
